WAS PERSONALLY POPULAR, PEOPLE

00:08:46.735 --> 00:08:48.036
APPRECIATED THE FACT THAT HE WAS

00:08:48.037 --> 00:08:51.239
AN EXCEPTIONAL CHARACTER, THE

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.106
FIRST AFRICAN-AMERICAN PRESIDENT

00:08:52.107 --> 00:08:54.042
AND THEY WERE A CROWD OF THAT

00:08:54.043 --> 00:08:54.342
FACT.

00:08:54.343 --> 00:08:57.011
HIS POLICIES WERE HOLY

00:08:57.012 --> 00:08:57.478
UNPOPULAR.

00:08:57.479 --> 00:08:59.981
IN SOME WAYS THAT'S THE MIRROR

00:08:59.982 --> 00:09:02.150
IMAGE, PERSONALLY NOT SO POPULAR

00:09:02.151 --> 00:09:03.184
BUT HIS POLICIES ARE INCREDIBLY

00:09:03.185 --> 00:09:05.353
POPULAR.

00:09:05.354 --> 00:09:07.755
BUT GETTING BACK TO THE MELANIA

00:09:07.756 --> 00:09:09.257
ISSUE, ANY REPUBLICAN FIRST LADY

00:09:09.258 --> 00:09:11.392
IS GOING TO BE TREATED LIKE

00:09:11.393 --> 00:09:11.959
THIS, LARA.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:14.228
IT'S A FACT OF THE DOUBLE

00:09:14.229 --> 00:09:16.397
STANDARD LIFE IN AMERICA,

00:09:16.398 --> 00:09:16.831
UNFORTUNATELY.

00:09:16.832 --> 00:09:18.599
IT'S REALLY UNFAIR TO HER.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:20.001
I THINK AMERICANS BY AND LARGE

00:09:20.002 --> 00:09:22.937
ARE SICK OF THE DOUBLE STANDARD.

00:09:22.938 --> 00:09:25.973
&gt;&gt; Laura: IT'S APPARENT.

00:09:25.974 --> 00:09:27.542
&gt;&gt; HE'S TRYING TO SMASH IT.

00:09:27.543 --> 00:09:29.811
&gt;&gt; Laura: IT'S APPARENT.

00:09:29.812 --> 00:09:32.180
WE ARE OUT OF TIME, BUT THE

00:09:32.181 --> 00:09:35.016
BUSHES DID NOT CRITICIZE THE

00:09:35.017 --> 00:09:35.350
OBAMAS.

00:09:35.351 --> 00:09:35.750
THEY DIDN'T.

00:09:35.751 --> 00:09:37.618
&gt;&gt; THAT'S CORRECT.

00:09:37.619 --> 00:09:41.656
&gt;&gt; WHY WOULD THEY!

00:09:41.657 --> 00:09:45.159
I KNOW YOU'RE TALKING TO CANDACE

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:45.760
CANDACE.

00:09:45.761 --> 00:09:48.029
&gt;&gt; Laura: BECAUSE WE HAD

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:50.365
BENGHAZI, --

00:09:50.366 --> 00:09:51.599
&gt;&gt; THEY ALSO DIDN'T QUESTION

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:54.068
WHETHER OR NOT OBAMA WAS BORN IN

00:09:54.069 --> 00:09:56.738
THIS COUNTRY.

00:09:56.739 --> 00:09:58.973
&gt;&gt; THESE ARE CHEAP SHOTS.

00:09:58.974 --> 00:10:03.211
&gt;&gt; I'M GOING TO FINISH MY

00:10:03.212 --> 00:10:05.347
THOUGHT.

